  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1231016/description_c9991c77-0353-4b47-b7bc-bb7f175554f0.png\" alt=\"標誌\" width=\"569\" height=\"449\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1231016/description_ecdcb02a-ba41-4de2-a7b3-dea875854266.png\" alt=\"模組名稱\" width=\"586\" height=\"69\"></span></strong></span></h1><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:10px\"><strong>終於，Raxiores 的新版本來啦！</strong></span></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>這個模組新增了 Raxiore 的自訂恐龍</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>這些恐龍可不只是用來展示的</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>我的生物並不是單純供人欣賞。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>大多數生物都擁有獨特的功能或與玩家的互動方式。<br>請不要只是殺掉牠們，你可以用其他方式獲得樂趣。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1231016/description_3d0c371f-3d66-4669-808c-9f25bceb0d0e.png\" alt=\"三角龍\" width=\"510\" height=\"458\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#999\">開發進度將在我的 YouTube 頻道和 Discord 伺服器上更新。</span></strong></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4EbqBJBXgH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1231016/description_c071ef2d-4428-49a4-982c-2ebf9847f9f6.png\" alt=\"對，點擊它\" width=\"807\" height=\"63\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong>我沒有從我的模組中獲取任何利潤。所以請考慮訂閱我的頻道！</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-XYVMC-YUqY4qtfF7yn7PA?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1231016/description_b287f251-887b-4f33-a986-7ce76a39bd8c.png\" alt=\"你必須點擊它\" width=\"806\" height=\"55\"></span></strong></span></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"color:#999;font-size:10px\">是時候享受你的 Lifiore 了！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"color:#999;font-size:10px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1231016/description_0cb7dab4-016b-4a36-8831-c6f72831615c.png\" alt=\"製作名單\" width=\"262\" height=\"80\"></strong></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#5ba0a3;text-decoration:underline\">[ 美術設計 ]</span></strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#9d9898\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fc1224\">[REO]&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#a38529\"><strong>[</strong></span><span style=\"color:#948a51\"><strong><span style=\"color:#a38529\">SELOBANG]</span> </strong></span><span style=\"color:#70443c\"><strong><span style=\"color:#a83d33\">[Lost World]</span>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"color:#9d9898\"><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">[JINI]</span>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>[Min Chan]</strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#a4ae4d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>[ 音效設計師 ]</strong></span></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#484038\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">[Hayden]</span> </strong></span><span style=\"color:#a38529\"><strong>[BananaCat]</strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#b85a44\"><strong>[ 動畫師 ]</strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#d41c2c\"><strong>[Ari Cat] <span style=\"color:#2d49e0\">[Dinosaur Man]</span></strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#a6699e\"><strong>[ 贊助者 ]</strong></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#9a91ac\"><strong>[Chrimson Steve] <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">[DarkBlade2017]</span></strong></span></h1>",
